Third-party components and references
-------------------------------------

Tailscale
  The plugin downloads and runs the official Tailscale `tailscale` and
  `tailscaled` binaries from https://pkgs.tailscale.com/stable/.
  Tailscale is a trademark of Tailscale Inc. This project is not affiliated
  with or endorsed by Tailscale Inc.

OpenMinis
  The embedded networking architecture was informed by the open-source
  OpenMinis project: https://github.com/OpenMinis/OpenMinis
  No OpenMinis source code is copied into this repository. OpenMinis is
  licensed separately by its own copyright holders.

Node.js / undici
  The plugin uses the Node.js runtime and the `undici` package provided by the
  dsh host environment. Node.js and undici retain their respective licenses.

